Photographer: {
	DisplayName: Photographer
	Name.0: Iris
	Entry: The Photographer travels across the world in search of the perfect photos to add to their collection. They sell misprints and old cameras to make a living.

	Chat: {
		First: Oh hello there traveller, I don't believe we've met before, name's {NPCFirstName_Rosemary/Photographer}.

		Generic: {
			0: Howdy traveller, find any good photo spots?
			1: Oh! Traveller, how've you been?
			2: Hey traveller, would any of the townies here be interested in a photoshoot? Free of charge of course.
			3: This island gives me the best photo opportunities!
			4: Happy to be back to this island, helps get my mind off of my failed polaroid lifts back home.
		}

		Forest: {
			0: Hey traveller, was just amiring the quiet forest; I even snapped a few good photos for my collection!
			1: Nice day for some pictures of the flower fields on this island.
			2: The sunflowers here are alot taller than the ones back up north, it's hard to get a pcture from a good angle!
		}

		Tundra: {
			0: The daylight just looks stunning reflecting off of the snowflakes! A perfect shot for my collection…
			Snowing.0: Ugh I can hardly capture anything, my lens keeps frosting over!
		}

		Night: {
			0: Unfortunately stars don't show up too well on film, but I managed to capture a few good long exposures!
			1: Whoa! Traveller, didn't see ya there! Don't scare me like that, I may mess up this perfect shot!
			Forest.0: I can barely catch the moon from behind the treeline at this angle!
			Tundra.0: Hey traveller, can you believe it? Aurora Borealis!? At this time of year? Located entirely within this biome?
			FullMoon.0: Hey traveller, caught a nice photo of the full moon, I bet it'll look great fully developed!
		}
	}
}
